        address issuer;
        uint64 expiration;
        address recipient;
        /// @dev Block of the `Shared` event that carries the full ACP and the metadata
        ///      (the L2 block on Arbitrum). The last `Shared` event for the share id in that
        ///      block, should it hold more than one.
